<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/24/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/name> "The principal Act is amended by inserting,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/24/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "immediately after section 48A, the following new section 48B: Monies for 48B. (1) No person shall carry on any activity Fund to to raise monies for the Fund without the prior be raised only with written consent of the Committee. consent. (2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/24/eng@> .
